  longerTitle: Large Animals
  description: 'Dealing with large animals, such as horses, during an evacuation
    can be difficult. It is very important to make plans in advance and consider
    multiple\r\nscenarios and consequences of choices. Choosing to take the animals
    during the evacuation notice causes additional congestion on the roads, but for
    many people leaving their animals behind is not an option. Consider relocating
    the animals to a defensible location during risky conditions to increase their
    safety as well as the safety of everyone else who\r\nneeds to evacuate.

'
